1
00:00:00,502 --> 00:00:03,592
(Sheldon:)I sense you're making a joke,
but Bozeman does have...

2
00:00:03,755 --> 00:00:07,505
(Sheldon:)...a comedy club called the Loony Bin,
so do not forward my mail there.

3
00:00:07,718 --> 00:00:12,518
(Howard:)Oh, come on. So you were the victim
of a crime. That's part of life.

4
00:00:12,681 --> 00:00:15,351
(Howard:)When my great-grandfather
first came to this country...

5
00:00:15,517 --> 00:00:19,057
(Howard:)...he put all his hopes and dreams
into this little butcher shop...

6
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:22,609
(Howard:)...he ran on the Lower East Side
of New York. You know what happened?

7
00:00:22,774 --> 00:00:25,024
(Howard:)Every customer who
walked into that butcher shop...

8
00:00:25,193 --> 00:00:26,613
(Howard:)...and asked for a pound of liver...

9
00:00:26,778 --> 00:00:27,778
[SNAPS FINGERS]

10
00:00:27,946 --> 00:00:28,986
(Howard:)...got ripped off.

11
00:00:30,782 --> 00:00:35,532
(Howard:)But those people moved on,
and so should you.

12
00:00:35,746 --> 00:00:39,376
(Sheldon:)I am moving on.
I'm going to be a Bozite.

13
00:00:39,583 --> 00:00:41,463
(Leonard:)They call themselves Bozites?

14
00:00:41,668 --> 00:00:45,548
(Sheldon:)They should. It's one of the first things
I plan to bring up upon arrival.

15
00:00:46,256 --> 00:00:49,426
(Penny:)Sheldon, I can't believe I'm saying this,
but I'm gonna miss you.

16
00:00:49,593 --> 00:00:53,723
(Sheldon:)Please, Penny. As you know, I'm not
comfortable with prolonged goodbyes...

17
00:00:53,889 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)...and maudlin displays of emotion,
so I've prepared a short video.

